WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:11.990
Come in.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.580
Headmaster Moroboshi, it is a pleasure to see you again.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.000
Well, well. The pleasure is all mine.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:28.880
Aikatsu. Aikatsu.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.220
Caroline?

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.350
Did she bring something for us?

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.610
It's addressed to you, Yume.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:51.030
You're right. I wonder what's inside.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:57.120
It's a treat from Koukadou! How cute!

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.490
But why for me?

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:02.200
Yume, I think that's a fortune cookie. {which apparently are of japanese origin, not chinese, and yet no japanese person knows what it is}{I was always under the impression it was of american origin}

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.830
There's a paper fortune inside.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.420
Really? Sounds exciting.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.000
I wonder if that's this year's new product.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.630
Better give it a taste.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.510
It came out.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.760
"Audition Ticket"... {last year it said アタリ}

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.350
Wait, then...

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:24.480
This year too?

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:02.820
So you're looking for a new Koukadou campaign girl.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.330
Two years ago it was Nikaidou Yuzu-chan, and last year was Sakuraba Rola-chan.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.170
They've both done a wonderful job.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.920
We're honored by your praise.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:20.130
Thanks to them, we were able to make it to the twentieth anniversary of the Koukadou campaign girl audition.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:22.720
I was thinking of shaking things up for the occasion.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:26.810
We'll be holding a campaign unit audition instead.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.020
Oh, a unit this time?

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:38.690
I've sent audition tickets to the idols I believe would be suited for the position.

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.450
"Audition Ticket"...

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.410
Have you found the particulars of this campaign girl thing?

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.160
Yes, please take a look.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.880
If your only wish is to be happy

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.840
all you need to do is eat one of these!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.300
Create your own miracle!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.300
Miracle!

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.010
Felicitaiyaki!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.630
What is this?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.590
V-Very intriguing.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:06.970
B-But...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.980
There shouldn't be any need for you to take this kind of audition, Elza.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.850
Elza-sama!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.230
Hey, hey! Listen, listen!

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.110
Kirara's gonna take part in an audition! Look!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.360
<b>A{*\frz342.614}u{*\frz341.429}d{*\frz340.243}i{*\frz339.057}t{*\frz337.871}i{*\frz336.686}on</b>

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.360
<b>T{*\frz12.208}i{*\frz11.406}c{*\frz10.604}k{*\frz9.802}et</b>

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.860
You received one as well?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.570
Huh? You got a cookie too?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.660
No, not me. It was addressed to Elza.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:31.700
I know.{I know but}

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.790
Elza, shall I take it in your place?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.790
No, that will not be necessary.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.210
I'll take this audition.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.470
Elza, are you serious?

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:49.470
Yay! Kirara gets to do an audition with Elza-sama! That's super duper happy!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:50.850
I'm serious.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.850
However...

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.890
It's my decision.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.610
Koukadou, huh.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.190
Is that true?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:07.320
I'm so glad I could take this with you.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.080
Let's work hard together.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.620
I am also looking forward to being here with you.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.580
As proof...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.420
A peach?

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:22.050
In China, there exists a phrase: Oath of the Peach Garden. {from, as expected, romance of the three kingdoms}

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.050
Peach Garden Oath

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:30.050
It comes from a story where three heroes take an oath of fraternity in a peach garden.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.140
The words mean to unite your powers.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:39.190
Today we are as one. Our hands will grasp victory together.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.360
Okay, let's do our best!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.150
I'm sorry, but it will not go your way.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.110
You two are from Shiny Academy.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.860
That's Naruse Ayumi to you.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.660
And Aoyama Naho.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.660
It's been so long! Looks like we get to compete again.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.540
Yes, I'm very excited for it.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:01.420
Listen closely. <i>We</i> will be the ones to claim victory this time.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.460
Not if we can help it!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.880
Good day.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.510
Elza-san.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.430
Kirara's here too!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.220
You must be... Elza Forte-san?

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.100
Yes.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:17.270
She's going to be participating in the same audition as us?

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.770
There's no way!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:25.280
Yume Nijino, the goddess of victory has already decided to smile upon me today. {ep 16}

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.150
The battle has not yet begun.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.360
That's right. We won't lose.

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.910
If you think so, just try and steal the goddess's favor from me.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.290
There you have it! Good luck, everyone!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.880
How lovely!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.010
I didn't expect Elza-san to be here.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:49.050
Yes, I'm honestly surprised.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.970
However, hearing her proclaim that fate is on her side

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.850
only strengthens my will to oppose her!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:58.020
Right, let's win this!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.140
Yeah!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.440
Why do you think we were invited too?

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.650
You're fine with doing this?

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.280
Sure, I'm into it.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:13.910
Just think about it. We're the only guys surrounded by a field of girls.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.040
Such paradise hardly ever comes by.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.950
What's that mean?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:22.330
We get to fully enjoy the role of princes letting the ladies shine.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.670
I get it!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.630
I sure hope Yume and Lily-senpai win.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:34.930
As do I. They have to show everyone the abilities of Four Star Academy.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:41.230
Yah-ho! It's finally time for the annual Koukadou audition!{I should say something but...}{finally, I win!}

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:45.110
You don't even have to be here at the venue to be in on it.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:49.610
Those of you at home all over the country can enjoy watching it on TV.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:55.280
We'll be your hosts! Happy Koi-Koi Konpeito Nikaidou Yuzu, and...

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.410
Create a miracle Felicitaiyaki, Sakuraba Rola!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.000
We're happy to be here.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.380
So without further ado, let's start the audition!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.380
First up is a very special appearance!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.380
Hello, everyone.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:15.640
I am the president of Koukadou, Koumoto Kaoru.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:19.640
Welcome to the twentieth annual Koukadou audition.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:24.230
Following Happy Koi-Koi Konpeito and Felicitaiyaki,

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:28.650
Koukadou will be opening a brand-new shop.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.650
We're here to choose a campaign unit for Ko-cafe.

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:40.700
Ko-cafe proposes to mix Eastern spirit with Western vigor into a completely new type of café.{why is it not Ko-café}{feel free to edit it in}

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:47.960
We are looking for a unit capable of combining 
East and West into a whole greater than its parts.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:05.480
Welcome back! Let's get this Koukadou campaign unit audition on the road.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:09.440
As always, we'll be testing their knowledge, stamina, and luck.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:12.070
Which unit will rise to the top?

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:16.030
The first stage is a true-or-false quiz!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:20.700
Don't forget, our job is to let the princesses shine.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.160
Don't worry, I know.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:26.500
Only the units who pass this quiz will proceed to the next stage.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.130
Listen carefully before answering.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:30.590
Here's the question:

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:39.600
The Happy Koi-Koi Konpeito campaign girl, Nikaidou Yuzu's, favorite flavor of konpeito is strawberry—

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:45.060
In comparison, President Koumoto's favorite flavor is melon.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.730
Please push the button for either true or false.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.150
This is way too much.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.320
No way anyone would know.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.610
Lily-senpai, what do you think?

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:59.490
Not even I know what the president's favorite flavor is.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.910
We will have to entrust ourselves to luck.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.290
Let's go with true.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.290
Okay.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:12.090
Melon, huh? Kirara likes it...

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.300
The answer is true.

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.050
Huh? Really?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.050
Trust me.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.590
If you say so, then it must be!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.680
Elza-san seemed really confident in her answer.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.390
No way! Even for her...

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.600
Looks like everyone's answered.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.650
But which was the right choice?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.320
President Koumoto, please let us know.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:38.780
The right answer is...

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:39.860
True!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.660
Yes!

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:46.000
These four teams cleared the first stage.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.960
Let's introduce them for our viewers.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.960
The Elza Forte and Hanazono Kirara team.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.960
The Nijino Yume and Shirogane Lily team.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.210
The Naruse Ayumi and Aoyama Naho team.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.470
And the Kasumi Asahi and Igarashi Nozomu team.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.470
Next is a test to see who's ready for the café's opening!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.100
Carry a glass tower!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.600
Stack as many glasses as you can on top of a tray.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:16.480
The two units who reach the goal with the most glasses in the least time move on to the finals.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.150
Approach it calmly.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:19.820
Okay.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.320
It looks like everyone's ready.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.620
Here we go!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.830
Ready, start!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.960
You're good to go, Naho-san.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.050
Take it slowly!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.050
Th-This is heavy...

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.470
Ayumi-san, I'm so sorry!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:50.600
Oh no! The Ayumi and Naho team have spilled their glasses!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.350
They'll have to return to the start line and stack again.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.230
There's still plenty of time!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:59.820
Elza-sama, hurry! We're gonna be last!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:03.280
Don't fret. Just relax, Kirara.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.120
We will not lose.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.870
Okay, got it.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.700
This look good to you?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.960
Yeah, it's just right.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.170
Can you put a few more on top?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.000
Okay.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.250
Now our job is to make this interesting.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:24.510
I'll keep it close, and once I'm about to reach the goal in first place, I'll trip on purpose.

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:26.640
You're ready!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.220
Thanks. I'll take care of the rest.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:44.360
You won't make it into the lead, so start the gag and trip over—

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.160
Huh? Wait, Nozomu-kun?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.410
He got all serious for some reason.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.540
Come on, don't let your stubbornness get the best of you.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.040
Goal!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:02.050
The Elza and Kirara team take first during the second stage!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.050
What an elegant finish!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.550
It looked like their glasses were glued to the tray.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.600
Following in second was the Lily and Yume team.{my fix in qc}

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.560
They had great teamwork.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.100
Sorry.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.150
"Let them shine" my foot.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:18.190
My switch just got flipped.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.900
It's unfortunate...

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.070
We've lost once again...

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:29.370
We've reached the finals where Lily and Yume will face Elza and Kirara head-on!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:34.080
The last stage of the Koukadou campaign unit audition is...

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.710
Add a new dish to the Ko-cafe menu!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:41.000
Each team will create a new cake fitting the shop's image.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.420
This is a real toughie right at the end.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.340
They'll need both baking knowledge and relevant technique.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.970
This is a difficult challenge.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.100
But this could be their chance.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:51.850
Huh?

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:56.440
Remember? Elza-san relies on her butler and the chefs for everything on the ship. {I will avoid Jiiya for as long as possible}{which will be forever if I have my way}

00:13:56.770 --> 00:14:00.360
I see. Yume has the advantage here.

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:03.650
Nobody can compete with someone who grew up in a confectionery shop.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:08.530
Which team will take home the title of campaign unit?

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:11.410
Start the final round!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:15.080
What do you think of something like this?

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.540
Yes, it looks marvelous.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:19.960
We're gonna make this?

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.090
That's right.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.960
Come, let's hurry.

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.710
Kirara's ready!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.260
We're approaching the time limit.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:36.730
I'm so excited to see what kind of cakes they'll have prepared!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.730
Time's up!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:42.690
Let's take a look at what they've baked!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.190
First is Lily and Yume.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.860
It's a matcha chestnut roll cake.{hey, it's sunday}{oozora wakari}

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.410
It looks delicious!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.740
That was far beyond my expectations.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:58.080
We added matcha flavoring to the sponge cake.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:04.960
Wrapped up inside the roll is a mix of Koukadou's specialties, candied chestnuts and sweet red bean paste. {or coarse anko}

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:09.760
Delicious!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.800
The matcha flavor's going right to my head!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.010
President Koumoto, what do you think?

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:20.520
The Ko-cafe will offer East-West fusion confectioneries.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.520
This is West on the outside, East on the inside.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.280
It fits right along with our shop's image.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:32.320
Next is Elza and Kirara.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.120
Wow, their cake looks like a French doll!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.330
How stunningly beautiful!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:45.840
This is...

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.180
President Koumoto?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:54.850
The French doll cake was created by the previous president—

00:15:54.850 --> 00:16:00.640
In other words, my father made this dreamlike Eastern cake for me when I was younger.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.390
Huh?

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:11.070
This French doll is imbued with Eastern spirit in the konpeito gems scattered around her dress.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:17.580
That, along with the memories of my father, makes this my favorite cake ever.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:24.580
He said that you were fond of melon-flavored konpeito when he invented that cake.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:31.170
That inspired him to create konpeito in a variety of fruit flavors.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.680
You researched that deeply?

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:44.060
I knew it! Elza-san investigated Koukadou and President Koumoto just for this audition.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.150
And she did it perfectly.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:57.240
It's wonderful! My memories of those times are flooding back.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:01.330
Thank you. I'm not sure what else to say.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:09.000
I also learned something from the discovery of such a fashionable cake.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.920
The world is created from fashion. {yes, not passion}

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:17.050
It is what brings passion, happiness, and joy to people.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:20.350
That is true of both cakes and dresses.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:27.150
It's time to announce the winners of the Koukadou campaign unit audition!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.650
President Koumoto, if you would!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.610
The winners are...

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.360
Elza and Kirara!

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:42.160
I finally understand why Elza wanted to take this audition.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:47.920
She continues to exceed my wildest imaginations.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.250
Congratulations.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.260
That was admirable.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.260
Thank you.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.090
But my victory was only natural.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.510
I won't lose next time!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.100
Let's finish this up right!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:08.650
With a performance by the winners, Elza and Kirara!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:13.280
This is going to be amazing! Everyone get ready to party!{not that yours was bad}

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:20.120
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:23.290
For I am perfect!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:57.790
A master of one art can excel in all others.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.750
Elza-san puts it on full display.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:05.300
She can apply her fashion sense to a field as disparate as baking.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:09.720
Now we see another reason why she's known as Perfect Elza.

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.260
Yes, we can.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:17.230
One day, I want to catch up to Elza-san and then surpass her.

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:20.110
That feeling is now stronger than ever.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:59.700
Kirara's school dress is the Milky Venus Coord.

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.750
It's really adorable!

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:06.800
Yeah, the colors were so vibrant, it was like you were a flower blooming on stage.

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:10.050
Didn't you have a fluffy sweet dream?

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.180
Yume, what kind of dress do you want to make?

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:15.510
I'm still not totally sure.

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:17.890
Then let's go fish for ideas!

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:20.390
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:22.020
Shine for you.

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.350
Become the first-star idol!
